name: Stash Pro 分流策略
desc: 在已导入并能显示节点的机场配置上启用；使用机场配置中的节点，无需机场入口覆写。
# revision 1.0.3 / 2026-09-25
# 本覆写接管策略组和分流规则；机场订阅配置提供节点并保留其 DNS/隧道设置。
# 可选的 App/YouTube 去广告覆写需单独启用。

mode: rule

proxy-groups: #!replace
  - name: 默认代理
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Global.png
    proxies: [美国节点, 稳定切换, 手动节点, REJECT]
  - name: 稳定切换
    type: fallback
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Available.png
    include-all: true
    interval: 120
    lazy: false
    # 按订阅顺序选健康节点，优先节点恢复后可能切回；不保证既有连接迁移。
    # 不用地区 filter，避免新机场命名不同导致空组被 Stash 当成 DIRECT。
  - name: 手动节点
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Static.png
    include-all: true
    interval: 600
    lazy: true
  - name: 美国节点
    type: fallback
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/United_States.png
    include-all: true
    filter: '(?i)(^|[^a-z])(us|usa|united states)([^a-z]|$)|美国|美國|美西|美东|美東|美中|🇺🇸'
    interval: 120
    lazy: false
  - name: 新加坡节点
    type: fallback
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Singapore.png
    include-all: true
    filter: '(?i)(^|[^a-z])(sg|singapore)([^a-z]|$)|新加坡|狮城|獅城|🇸🇬'
    interval: 120
    lazy: false
  - name: YouTube
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/YouTube.png
    proxies: [美国节点, 稳定切换, 手动节点, REJECT]
  - name: AI
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Bot.png
    proxies: [美国节点, 默认代理, 手动节点]
    # 不展开机场节点；Google/Gemini 与 AI 同走美国池。
  - name: Google
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Google.png
    proxies: [美国节点, AI, 默认代理, 手动节点]
    # 默认与 AI 共用美国池，使 Google 登录、Gemini API 出口对齐。
  - name: 国际媒体
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/ForeignMedia.png
    proxies: [美国节点, 默认代理, 手动节点]
  - name: Spotify
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Spotify.png
    proxies: [新加坡节点, 美国节点, 手动节点, REJECT]
  - name: Telegram
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Telegram.png
    proxies: [默认代理, 手动节点]
  - name: Apple
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Apple.png
    proxies: [DIRECT, 默认代理]
  - name: Microsoft
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Microsoft.png
    proxies: [DIRECT, 默认代理]
  - name: 广告过滤
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Advertising.png
    proxies: [REJECT, DIRECT]
    # DIRECT 仅用于诊断网络层误杀，不会关闭独立的 HTTP 去广告覆写。
  - name: 兜底流量
    type: select
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Final.png
    proxies: [默认代理, DIRECT]

# 采用 indexed domain/ipcidr 清单，不叠加多个庞大、重叠的广告规则集。
# release 是可更新清单；审核脚本会验证内容而不只检查 HTTP 200。
rule-providers: #!replace
  Ads:
    behavior: domain
    format: yaml
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/clash-rules/release/reject.txt
    path: ./rules/stash-pro-ads.yaml
    interval: 86400
  ChinaDomains:
    behavior: domain
    format: yaml
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/clash-rules/release/direct.txt
    path: ./rules/stash-pro-china.yaml
    interval: 86400
  PrivateDomains:
    behavior: domain
    format: yaml
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/clash-rules/release/private.txt
    path: ./rules/stash-pro-private.yaml
    interval: 86400
  ChinaIPs:
    behavior: ipcidr
    format: yaml
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/clash-rules/release/cncidr.txt
    path: ./rules/stash-pro-cn-ip.yaml
    interval: 86400

rules: #!replace
  # 1. 局域网与解析器，不强制解析未命中的境外域名。
  - DOMAIN,dns.alidns.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,doh.pub,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lan,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,local,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,home.arpa,DIRECT
  - RULE-SET,PrivateDomains,DIRECT
  - IP-CIDR,127.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR,169.254.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR6,::1/128,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR6,fc00::/7,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR6,fe80::/10,DIRECT,no-resolve

  # 2. 国内登录/通信与易误伤的正文接口优先，保护的是具体功能域而非整个 CDN。
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.qq.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.qq.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qq.com.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,teg.tencent-cloud.net,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechat.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinbridge.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tenpay.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,api.weibo.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,sub.weibo.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,we.weibo.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,api.zhihu.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,www.zhihu.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,zhuanlan.zhihu.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN,edith.xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT

  # 3. 网络层广告拦截。共享正文域的广告交给独立 HTTP 覆写，不能封杀整个域。
  - RULE-SET,Ads,广告过滤

  # 4. YouTube 的应用层 UDP 443 回落 TCP；不封禁全局 UDP/HY2/TUIC 隧道。
  - AND,((DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevideo.com),(NETWORK,udp),(DST-PORT,443)),REJECT
  - AND,((DOMAIN,youtubei.googleapis.com),(NETWORK,udp),(DST-PORT,443)),REJECT
  - DOMAIN,init-stream.maasea.workers.dev,YouTube
  - DOMAIN,youtubei.googleapis.com,YouTube
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtube.com,YouTube
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtu.be,YouTube
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,youtube-nocookie.com,YouTube
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevideo.com,YouTube
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ytimg.com,YouTube
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ggpht.com,YouTube

  # 5. AI 在 Google / Microsoft / 国内清单之前，避免 Gemini/Copilot 被宽规则吞掉。
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,auth0.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai,AI
  - DOMAIN,gemini.google.com,AI
  - DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com,AI
  - DOMAIN,ai.google.dev,AI
  - DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com,AI
  - DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com,AI
  - DOMAIN,makersuite.google.com,AI
  - DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com,AI
  - DOMAIN,copilot.microsoft.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bing.com,AI
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com,Google
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com,Google
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com,Google
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleusercontent.com,Google
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com.hk,Google
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.co.jp,Google

  # 6. 国际通信/媒体与代码托管。
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegram.org,Telegram
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t.me,Telegram
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegra.ph,Telegram
  - IP-CIDR,149.154.160.0/20,Telegram,no-resolve
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,netflix.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nflxvideo.net,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nflximg.net,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nflxso.net,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nflxext.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,disneyplus.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dssott.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bamgrid.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify.com,Spotify
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,scdn.co,Spotify
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotify.link,Spotify
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotifycdn.com,Spotify
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktok.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokv.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokcdn.com,国际媒体
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,github.com,默认代理
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubusercontent.com,默认代理
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubassets.com,默认代理
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com,Apple
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.com,Apple
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud-content.com,Apple
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,microsoft.com,Microsoft
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,live.com,Microsoft
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,office.com,Microsoft
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,office365.com,Microsoft
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,windowsupdate.com,Microsoft

  # 7. 国内业务、国内地址，最后未分类默认代理（可在策略面板手动切换）。
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weibo.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weibo.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sinaimg.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zhihu.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zhimg.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qq.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qpic.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qlogo.cn,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xiaohongshu.com,DIRECT
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xhscdn.com,DIRECT
  - RULE-SET,ChinaDomains,DIRECT
  - RULE-SET,ChinaIPs,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - GEOIP,CN,DIRECT,no-resolve
  - MATCH,兜底流量
